(label "BMI_CS" (at 350.52 54.61 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "c90f27ae-268f-4afe-b1e4-3d91eb437008"))
(text "NOTES (V1-draft4, 2026-10-24)\nU1: DevKitC-1 N8R8 in 2x 1x22 sockets. USB end = board bottom edge, antenna = top edge; reversed insertion shorts 3V3 to GND.\nJ1: ProtoCentral MAX30001 breakout v1.0 (check received revision vs SV1 pinout before plugging).\n    Breakout mods before human use: R3 (VCM to jack sleeve) 10k -> 220k 1% (datasheet: VCM electrode >= 200k);\n    remove R7, R8 (0R, electrodes to BIP/BIN); BioZ not used (EN_BIOZ = 0).\n    Firmware: INTB_TYPE = 01 (CMOS) in EN_INT 0x02 and EN_INT2 0x03; SPI <= 4 MHz.\nR9-R11: 33R source series for BMI270 SPI over 20-30 cm ribbon (tune on scope); BMI SPI start 1 MHz, lowest drive.\nJ2: keyed IDC 2x8, same pinout as wrist J1: 3V3/GND at 1-2, GND between signals, MOSI-MISO at 15-16.\nJ3: STIM (GPIO6) + GND, pulse output for the 10-min sync stimulus (board bottom strip).\nC9 100n on the B side right at J2.1/J2.2 (cable entry). B side carries R9-R11 and C9: use rubber feet.\nTP1 3V3, TP2 GND, TP4 PPG_SCL, TP5 BMI_SCK (cable side), TP6 T0_BTN." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 100.00 30.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b62909d9-8fc0-4826-b1d7-35161c4663dc"))
